    "background_story": "Ruben was a mysterious and enigmatic figure in the small town of Ravenswood. He lived on the outskirts, in a crooked little cottage that seemed to lean in, as if sharing a secret. The townsfolk whispered about Ruben's alleged involvement in the dark arts, claiming he was a warlock who practiced witching hours under the light of the full moon. While some feared him, others sought his guidance, believing his powers could heal and protect. Ruben's eyes seemed to hold a deep wisdom, and his presence was both captivating and unsettling. As the witching hour approached, Ruben would often be seen walking the woods, his long coat billowing behind him, leaving a trail of intrigue and mystique in his wake.",
